{"id": "X-CFG-001", "page": "configuration.md", "anchor": "engineconfig", "text": "In the LiteRT-LM Swift wrapper (swift/Config.swift is identical in agello-next 7b872544 and the shipped 85b1a776), EngineConfig.init defaults backend to .cpu() and visionBackend, audioBackend, maxNumTokens, cacheDir, loraRank, audioLoraRank and activationDataType to nil; Engine.initialize passes the main, vision and audio backend strings to litert_lm_engine_settings_create and calls the max-num-tokens, cache-dir, activation-type, LoRA-rank and audio-LoRA-rank setters only for non-nil values, in both wrappers.", "tier": "A", "kind": "code-structure", "sources": [{"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3", "pin": "7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6", "path": "swift/Config.swift", "lines": [109, 130], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "dbfb2380f17d10558b96169cac0938a7848eb1be", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM/blob/df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3/swift/Config.swift#L109-L130"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3", "pin": "7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6", "path": "swift/Engine.swift", "lines": [73, 85], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "582415286e9c35df468671b7caa637e11ec3eb23", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM/blob/df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3/swift/Engine.swift#L73-L85"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3", "pin": "7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6", "path": "swift/Engine.swift", "lines": [88, 133], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "54f27a496f0ecc05863b356f1f118a54e0701858", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM/blob/df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3/swift/Engine.swift#L88-L133"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm-shipped", "sha": "b2f686e2ed4718fb84ec398a61dd59ca0f0aff27", "pin": "85b1a77695bc90fc8b34a1f455bbe5b2c7fdceff", "path": "swift/Engine.swift", "lines": [88, 130], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "9b7344da0ef255dd89bfdc5d025670f561380786", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM/blob/b2f686e2ed4718fb84ec398a61dd59ca0f0aff27/swift/Engine.swift#L88-L130"}], "applies_to": {"platform": "all", "build": "both", "model_rev": ""}}
{"id": "X-CFG-002", "page": "configuration.md", "anchor": "conversationconfig", "text": "ConversationConfig.init (swift/Config.swift, identical in agello-next and the shipped wrapper) defaults systemMessage, samplerConfig, loraPath, audioLoraPath, thinkingConfig, visualTokenBudget, enableSpeculativeDecoding and chatTemplate to nil, initialMessages and tools to empty arrays, enableToolCallStreaming and enableResponseFormat to false and automaticToolCalling to true; Engine.createConversation passes samplerConfig, loraPath, audioLoraPath, enableSpeculativeDecoding and chatTemplate to the C API only when they are non-nil.", "tier": "A", "kind": "code-structure", "sources": [{"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3", "pin": "7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6", "path": "swift/Config.swift", "lines": [251, 265], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "f0cc35e851c5dbc400bb555c77a2be1e4840abf7", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM/blob/df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3/swift/Config.swift#L251-L265"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3", "pin": "7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6", "path": "swift/Engine.swift", "lines": [244, 268], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "3435c43c9db80bb52026a280bcf4ef0a8a385465", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM/blob/df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3/swift/Engine.swift#L244-L268"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3", "pin": "7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6", "path": "swift/Engine.swift", "lines": [270, 292], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "0b0b4bc2d6cf597eda9d079dad3508cddcf1f728", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM/blob/df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3/swift/Engine.swift#L270-L292"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3", "pin": "7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6", "path": "swift/Engine.swift", "lines": [325, 360], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "c9818655d5a72ac93f96960cdf8d302b3330c578", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM/blob/df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3/swift/Engine.swift#L325-L360"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm-shipped", "sha": "b2f686e2ed4718fb84ec398a61dd59ca0f0aff27", "pin": "85b1a77695bc90fc8b34a1f455bbe5b2c7fdceff", "path": "swift/Engine.swift", "lines": [208, 265], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "0ab955104ad472cb5d0076cccfe55fabfbcc42cc", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM/blob/b2f686e2ed4718fb84ec398a61dd59ca0f0aff27/swift/Engine.swift#L208-L265"}], "applies_to": {"platform": "all", "build": "both", "model_rev": ""}}
{"id": "X-CFG-003", "page": "configuration.md", "anchor": "per-message-arguments", "text": "SamplerConfig.init (swift/Config.swift) has no defaults for topK, topP and temperature and defaults seed to 0; Conversation.sendMessage and sendMessageStream (agello-next 7b872544) take per-message extraContext, repetitionPenaltyConfig, noRepeatNgramConfig, suppressTokensConfig, maxOutputTokens, thinkingConfig and responseFormat arguments, each defaulting to nil.", "tier": "A", "kind": "code-structure", "sources": [{"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3", "pin": "7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6", "path": "swift/Config.swift", "lines": [155, 176], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "616c38f3a2fc83912292fb2cb01eab2927e496c9", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM/blob/df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3/swift/Config.swift#L155-L176"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6", "pin": "7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6", "path": "swift/Conversation.swift", "lines": [124, 133], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "cabc0b3ceb7cbfa8c77dbb6c1182a5030125d77b", "url": "https://github.com/PowerBeef/agello-litert-lm/blob/7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6/swift/Conversation.swift#L124-L133"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6", "pin": "7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6", "path": "swift/Conversation.swift", "lines": [478, 487], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "cf6f49f1b2ac74b25a860e8359a0fcba9a480065", "url": "https://github.com/PowerBeef/agello-litert-lm/blob/7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6/swift/Conversation.swift#L478-L487"}], "applies_to": {"platform": "all", "build": "both", "model_rev": ""}}
{"id": "X-CFG-004", "page": "configuration.md", "anchor": "experimentalflags", "text": "The backing values of the Swift ExperimentalFlags (agello-next 7b872544) start as: enableBenchmark false, convertCamelToSnakeCaseInToolDescription true, enableConversationConstrainedDecoding false, enableConversationToolCallStreaming false, conversationToolCallStreamingChannelName \"tool_call\", and enableSpeculativeDecoding, visualTokenBudget, filterChannelContentFromKvCache, gpuEnableMetalResidencySet and enableYnnpack nil; the shipped wrapper's ExperimentalFlags.swift is the same except that it has no enableYnnpack.", "tier": "A", "kind": "code-structure", "sources": [{"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3", "pin": "7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6", "path": "swift/ExperimentalFlags.swift", "lines": [21, 48], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "72c4c90830accbe48d4145b5b912fbd06f10db43", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM/blob/df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3/swift/ExperimentalFlags.swift#L21-L48"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3", "pin": "7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6", "path": "swift/ExperimentalFlags.swift", "lines": [78, 127], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "5fee63c884087b2ca9ed783043be557cc167e03b", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM/blob/df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3/swift/ExperimentalFlags.swift#L78-L127"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3", "pin": "7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6", "path": "swift/ExperimentalFlags.swift", "lines": [147, 147], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "17f47254282efa07e7e25b90bf7714193d21ef09", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM/blob/df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3/swift/ExperimentalFlags.swift#L147"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3", "pin"