{"id": "X-CFG-005", "page": "configuration.md", "anchor": "embedding-engine", "text": "EmbeddingEngineConfig.init (swift/EmbeddingEngineConfig.swift, identical in agello-next and the shipped wrapper) defaults backend to .cpu() and visionBackend, audioBackend, cacheDir, maxInputLength and visionTokensPerImage to nil, and EmbeddingOptions.init defaults normalize, insertSpecialTokens, outputSize and visionTokensPerImage to nil, which the documentation describes as using the C++ engine default.", "tier": "A", "kind": "code-structure", "sources": [{"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3", "pin": "7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6", "path": "swift/EmbeddingEngineConfig.swift", "lines": [42, 58], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "9261bb6d64ce93d7d76e6c9b33bf1073c8a25009", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM/blob/df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3/swift/EmbeddingEngineConfig.swift#L42-L58"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3", "pin": "7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6", "path": "swift/EmbeddingEngineConfig.swift", "lines": [83, 95], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "a9a9e31ad89323f7a6bdabea84013b7b7c61e037", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM/blob/df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3/swift/EmbeddingEngineConfig.swift#L83-L95"}], "applies_to": {"platform": "all", "build": "both", "model_rev": ""}}
{"id": "X-CFG-006", "page": "configuration.md", "anchor": "setters-with-no-swift-counterpart", "text": "Neither the shipped Swift wrapper (85b1a776) nor agello-next's (7b872544) calls these C functions, so Swift apps can't change what they set: litert_lm_engine_settings_set_num_threads, _set_audio_num_threads, _set_parallel_file_section_loading, _set_single_threaded_execution, _set_max_num_images, _set_prefill_chunk_size, _set_gpu_decode_steps_per_sync, _set_gpu_wait_for_weight_uploads, _set_use_ringbuffers_local_attention, _set_litert_dispatch_lib_dir, litert_lm_session_config_set_max_output_tokens, litert_lm_session_config_set_apply_prompt_template, litert_lm_conversation_config_set_extra_context, litert_lm_set_min_log_level, litert_lm_embedding_engine_settings_set_min_input_length and _set_activation_data_type, and litert_lm_embedding_options_set_input_overflow_strategy.", "tier": "A", "kind": "code-structure", "sources": [{"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3", "pin": "7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6", "path": "c/engine.h", "lines": [747, 804], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "abf412ff118b69c4b0b3a2220e31672030d707c7", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM/blob/df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3/c/engine.h#L747-L804"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3", "pin": "7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6", "path": "c/engine.h", "lines": [887, 887], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "089adde510e1f7c3c2ee0b2ec2d2b21341b457c7", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM/blob/df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3/c/engine.h#L887"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3", "pin": "7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6", "path": "c/engine.h", "lines": [968, 1008], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "62822ad23870c58e408d16f9e2cf4e76a9d8ea36", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM/blob/df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3/c/engine.h#L968-L1008"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3", "pin": "7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6", "path": "c/engine.h", "lines": [306, 318], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "a364e7426e5766bc4063327dc6133571b1aadea0", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM/blob/df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3/c/engine.h#L306-L318"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3", "pin": "7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6", "path": "c/engine.h", "lines": [621, 621], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "9186474a8e3f8f445c68693988e018efbdeffa4e", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM/blob/df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3/c/engine.h#L621"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3", "pin": "7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6", "path": "c/conversation.h", "lines": [151, 151], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "418509a8ebf828365cae3a6719a307372c94e1a1", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM/blob/df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3/c/conversation.h#L151"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3", "pin": "7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6", "path": "c/embedding_engine.h", "lines": [221, 252], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "b59b8448365708aa6d2d995b26333e2ae9de10a4", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM/blob/df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3/c/embedding_engine.h#L221-L252"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3", "pin": "7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6", "path": "c/embedding_engine.h", "lines": [351, 351], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "03593bdca4b470c5250894bd756fe86f0ae4f41f", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM/blob/df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3/c/embedding_engine.h#L3