{"id": "X-CFG-007", "page": "configuration.md", "anchor": "what-agello-sets", "text": "Agello (93122b647a) passes a SamplerConfig built from its resolved topK, topP and temperature only to chat conversations and SamplerConfig(topK: 1, topP: 1, temperature: 0) to the transcription helper; its JSON helpers (enableResponseFormat true, speculative decoding off), its text helpers (helperTexts, speculative decoding from its plan) and its validation probe (ConversationConfig()) pass no sampler config.", "tier": "A", "kind": "code-behavior", "sources": [{"type": "agello", "path": "Agello/Inference/ChatEngine.swift", "commit": "93122b647a", "lines": [309, 334]}, {"type": "agello", "path": "Agello/Inference/ChatEngine.swift", "commit": "93122b647a", "lines": [478, 500]}, {"type": "agello", "path": "Agello/Inference/ChatEngine.swift", "commit": "93122b647a", "lines": [504, 530]}, {"type": "agello", "path": "Agello/Inference/ChatEngine.swift", "commit": "93122b647a", "lines": [538, 561]}, {"type": "agello", "path": "Agello/Inference/ChatEngine.swift", "commit": "93122b647a", "lines": [295, 307]}], "applies_to": {"platform": "apple", "build": "both", "model_rev": ""}}
{"id": "X-CFG-008", "page": "configuration.md", "anchor": "what-agello-sets", "text": "Agello (93122b647a) puts LiteRT-LM caches under Library/Caches/com.patricedery.agello.litertlm: with a runtime that reports no build id (Google's v0.18.0 binary) one folder per context size, kv-<maxNumTokens>, keeping the two most recently used; with a build that reports one (ours, litert_lm_get_build_info) a single folder kv-all-<build id> for every size; the embedder uses embedding or embedding-<build id>; and the benchmark engine passes the cache directory \":nocache\".", "tier": "A", "kind": "code-behavior", "sources": [{"type": "agello", "path": "Agello/Inference/EngineCache.swift", "commit": "93122b647a", "lines": [21, 38]}, {"type": "agello", "path": "Agello/Inference/EngineCache.swift", "commit": "93122b647a", "lines": [83, 130]}, {"type": "agello", "path": "Agello/AppState.swift", "commit": "93122b647a", "lines": [1139, 1150]}, {"type": "agello", "path": "Agello/Knowledge/Embedding.swift", "commit": "93122b647a", "lines": [76, 84]}], "applies_to": {"platform": "apple", "build": "both", "model_rev": ""}}
{"id": "X-CFG-009", "page": "configuration.md", "anchor": "gpu-options-litert-lm-sets", "text": "The main LLM executor requests Metal argument buffers too: its CreateCompilationOptions (runtime/executor/llm_executor_settings_utils.cc) calls SetCommonGpuOptions on the GPU compilation options, and SetCommonGpuOptions calls SetUseMetalArgumentBuffers(true) under #if defined(__APPLE__); the same call and the same setter are in the v0.18.0 source behind the shipped binary. Google's commit 172d6806 (2026-09-09) removed only the separate direct call from CreateCompilationOptions.", "tier": "A", "kind": "apple-path", "sources": [{"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6", "pin": "7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6", "path": "runtime/executor/llm_executor_settings_utils.cc", "lines": [160, 164], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "bb2e51c76b4f5405904e8d7927cf8356131f3f88", "url": "https://github.com/PowerBeef/agello-litert-lm/blob/7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6/runtime/executor/llm_executor_settings_utils.cc#L160-L164"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3", "pin": "7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6", "path": "runtime/executor/litert_compiled_model_executor_utils.cc", "lines": [1009, 1041], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "f50e294af806c636f686880c4d7ebec754c6f844", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM/blob/df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3/runtime/executor/litert_compiled_model_executor_utils.cc#L1009-L1041"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm-shipped", "sha": "b2f686e2ed4718fb84ec398a61dd59ca0f0aff27", "pin": "85b1a77695bc90fc8b34a1f455bbe5b2c7fdceff", "path": "runtime/executor/llm_executor_settings_utils.cc", "lines": [160, 164], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "57542e5a487d016e71b75c36f182e85a8d79aef8", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM/blob/b2f686e2ed4718fb84ec398a61dd59ca0f0aff27/runtime/executor/llm_executor_settings_utils.cc#L160-L164"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm-shipped", "sha": "b2f686e2ed4718fb84ec398a61dd59ca0f0aff27", "pin": "85b1a77695bc90fc8b34a1f455bbe5b2c7fdceff", "path": "runtime/executor/litert_compiled_model_executor_utils.cc", "lines": [928, 934], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "5493f6d57a9d5f0f0f444612c2ce1e7113cdcec1", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM/blob/b2f686e2ed4718fb84ec398a61dd59ca0f0aff27/runtime/executor/litert_compiled_model_executor_utils.cc#L928-L934"}], "applies_to": {"platform": "apple", "build": "both", "model_rev": ""}, "conflicts_with": ["APL-051 (apple-platform.md): 'The main LLM executor's CreateCompilationOptions doesn't set the option ... so the Gemma decoder's graphs don't use argument buffers.'"]}
{"id": "X-CFG-010", "page": "configuration.md", "anchor": "environment-variables", "text": "Outside our AGELLO_* switches, the LiteRT runtime and ML Drift delegate sources at LiteRT 362759838 read LITERT_DISABLE_OPENCL and LITERT_DISABLE_OPENGL only in OpenCL/OpenGL code (#if LITERT_HAS_OPENCL_SUPPORT / OPENGL) and the delegate debug variables only in delegate_opencl.cc and delegate_webgpu.cc, so none of them affects the Metal path; ML Drift 15fa9e2 reads only AGELLO_SIMULATE_APPLE_GPU and AGELLO_TELEMETRY_GRAPH_DIR.", "tier": "B", "kind": "code-behavior", "sources": [{"type": "code", "repo": "litert", "sha": "ca21dc99de51c76bdcc572afeea1dd937d3c9e5c", "pin": "362759838e34e1525f1cc27daddaf663a193c059", "path": "litert/runtime/gpu_environment.cc", "lines": [213, 225], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "26a8ab54fcbc76b55afb3c95dfdb43b10da450c5", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT/blob/ca21dc99de51c76bdcc572afeea1dd937d3c9e5c/litert/runtime/gpu_environment.cc#L213-L225"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert", "sha": "ca21dc99de51c76bdcc572afeea1dd937d3c9e5c", "pin": "362759838e34e1525f1cc27daddaf663a193c059", "path": "ml_drift_delegate/delegate/delegate_opencl.cc", "lines": [465, 470], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "747c0902808d246ce481856a8fd07e5dff645183", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT/blob/ca21dc99de51c76bdcc572afeea1dd937d3c9e5c/ml_drift_delegate/delegate/delegate_opencl.cc#L465-L470"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert", "sha": "ca21dc99de51c76bdcc572afeea1dd937d3c9e5c", "pin": "362759838e34e1525f1cc27daddaf663a193c059", "path": "ml_drift_delegate/delegate/delegate_webgpu.cc", "lines": [569, 574], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "ccd2230be094d31228dbd363de6339c6abb50b1c", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT/blob/ca21dc99de51c76bdcc572afeea1dd937d3c9e5c/ml_drift_delegate/delegate/delegate_webgpu.cc#L569-L574"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "ml-drift", "sha": "15fa9e2ba632145992299e3f04786dc1f575373c", "pin": "15fa9e2ba632145992299e3f