{"id": "X-CFG-011", "page": "configuration.md", "anchor": "bazel-configs-feature-flags-and-defines", "text": "In LiteRT-LM's build_config/BUILD (agello-next 7b872544), the bool_flags enable_sentencepiece_tokenizer, enable_huggingface_tokenizer, enable_minijinja_template, enable_constrained_decoding, enable_llguidance, enable_fst_constraints, enable_tool_use_parser, enable_gpu_backend, enable_npu_backend, enable_legacy_artisan_executors, enable_vision, enable_audio and enable_all_model_processors default to True, enable_diffusion_executor, enable_google_tensor_backend and enable_debugger default to False, and the per-family processor flags (enable_gemma_processors, qwen, fastvlm, lfm2, minicpm) are string flags defaulting to \"auto\".", "tier": "B", "kind": "code-structure", "sources": [{"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3", "pin": "7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6", "path": "build_config/BUILD", "lines": [89, 91], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "a105059e3e32a688c39bd520fd62ceb88422b08b", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM/blob/df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3/build_config/BUILD#L89-L91"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3", "pin": "7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6", "path": "build_config/BUILD", "lines": [360, 362], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "bbec7d9795b42dc2355987a92a938a52c5085ff7", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM/blob/df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3/build_config/BUILD#L360-L362"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3", "pin": "7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6", "path": "build_config/BUILD", "lines": [385, 387], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "67f38c96ce7688a4872d1447311231e72bcee5c5", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM/blob/df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3/build_config/BUILD#L385-L387"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3", "pin": "7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6", "path": "build_config/BUILD", "lines": [466, 468], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "4e8c155b949929953f9ef6f5dd47b23cb9200b41", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM/blob/df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3/build_config/BUILD#L466-L468"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3", "pin": "7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6", "path": "build_config/BUILD", "lines": [495, 497], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "7c08f9ad6bf36a819cc85649b760e94adef0b91e", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM/blob/df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3/build_config/BUILD#L495-L497"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3", "pin": "7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6", "path": "build_config/BUILD", "lines": [524, 527], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "02b51b2c458652b7b3581893c4571785e8174962", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM/blob/df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3/build_config/BUILD#L524-L527"}], "applies_to": {"platform": "all", "build": "documented", "model_rev": ""}}
{"id": "X-CFG-012", "page": "configuration.md", "anchor": "executor-settings-and-advancedsettings", "text": "AdvancedSettings (runtime/executor/llm_executor_settings.h) defaults: prefill_batch_sizes empty, num_output_candidates 1, configure_magic_numbers true, verify_magic_numbers false, clear_kv_cache_before_prefill true, num_logits_to_print_after_decode 0, gpu_madvise_original_shared_tensors true, gpu_enable_metal_residency_set false, is_benchmark false, enable_profiling false, preferred_device_substr empty, num_threads_to_upload and num_threads_to_compile -1, convert_weights_on_gpu true, wait_for_weights_conversion_complete_in_benchmark true, optimize_shader_compilation true, cache_compiled_shaders_only false, share_constant_tensors true, sampler_handles_input true, allow_src_quantized_fc_conv_ops, hint_waiting_for_completion, gpu_context_low_priority and hint_kernel_batch_size unset, enable_speculative_decoding false, disable_delegate_clustering false, error_on_invalid_sampled_token_id false; GpuConfig defaults max_top_k 64 and external_tensor_mode false; CpuConfig defaults kv_increment_size 16, prefill_chunk_size -1 and number_of_threads 4.", "tier": "B", "kind": "code-structure", "sources": [{"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3", "pin": "7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6", "path": "runtime/executor/llm_executor_settings.h", "lines": [167, 311], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "01c08dcd0b216f184993ac3a1279348a57541e2b", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM/blob/df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3/runtime/executor/llm_executor_settings.h#L167-L311"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3", "pin": "7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6", "path": "runtime/executor/llm_executor_settings.h", "lines": [109, 141], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "00afcc06a74aaaef86e752f73702d75b3cb4eeb4", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM/blob/df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3/runtime/executor/llm_executor_settings.h#L109-L141"}], "applies_to": {"platform": "all", "build": "both", "model_rev": ""}}
{"id": "X-CFG-013", "page": "configuration.md", "anchor": "enginesettings-and-sessionconfig", "text": "In runtime/engine/engine_settings.h, EngineSettings defaults parallel_file_section_loading to true, single_threaded_execution to false and max_vision_tokens_per_image to unset, and SessionConfig defaults audio and vision modality to disabled, enable_audio_session_advanced false, start_token_id -1, num_output_candidates 1, sampler_backend UNSPECIFIED, apply_prompt_template_in_session true, use_external_sampler false, max_output_tokens std::numeric_limits<int>::max() and enable_speculative_decoding unset.", "tier": "B", "kind": "code-structure", "sources": [{"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3", "pin": "7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6", "path": "runtime/engine/engine_settings.h", "lines": [184, 190], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "426ede613b3d17d62365b13bd23af98278031608", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM/blob/df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3/runtime/engine/engine_settings.h#L184-L190"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3", "pin": "7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6", "path": "runtime/engine/engine_settings.h", "lines": [332, 395], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "ec25a9d67291a9f2da50a2232408c6fbc5809fee", "url": "https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT-LM/blob/df6df5b84d5845b49889f631ed4cac80b4325dd3/runtime/engine/engine_settings.h#L332-L395"}], "applies_to": {"platform": "all", "build": "both", "model_rev": ""}}
{"id": "X-CFG-014", "page": "configuration.md", "anchor": "environment-variables", "text": "Our telemetry (agello/telemetry/agello/agello_telemetry.cc) reads AGELLO_TELEMETRY once, when the library's static atomic level is initialized at load (unset or empty gives level 1, counters; otherwise its atoi value clamped to 0..4), and a static ExitReport object registers the exit-time snapshot writer at load only if AGELLO_TELEMETRY_OUT is set then; the writer reads the path again at exit.", "tier": "B", "kind": "code-behavior", "sources": [{"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6", "pin": "7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6", "path": "agello/telemetry/agello/agello_telemetry.cc", "lines": [52, 59], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "6675724572c7bda510f4ec76ff86d7754e3c6bc5", "url": "https://github.com/PowerBeef/agello-litert-lm/blob/7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6/agello/telemetry/agello/agello_telemetry.cc#L52-L59"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert-lm", "sha": "7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6", "pin": "7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6", "path": "agello/telemetry/agello/agello_telemetry.cc", "lines": [755, 772], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "c1d03541ad871b133a67c931196575d98e16a041", "url": "https://github.com/PowerBeef/agello-litert-lm/blob/7b872544fdbd81308f98b1e2acf8c5798a549df6/agello/telemetry/agello/agello_telemetry.cc#L755-L772"}], "applies_to": {"platform": "all", "build": "documented", "model_rev": ""}}
{"id": "X-CFG-015", "page": "configuration.md", "anchor": "environment-variables", "text": "In our LiteRT delegate (362759838), AGELLO_SHARED_WEIGHT_CACHE (on unless exactly \"0\") and AGELLO_VERIFY_DIRECT_COPIES (on only when the value starts with '1') are read once per process into function-local statics, while SimulatedAppleGpu() reads AGELLO_SIMULATE_APPLE_GPU again on every call.", "tier": "B", "kind": "code-behavior", "sources": [{"type": "code", "repo": "litert", "sha": "362759838e34e1525f1cc27daddaf663a193c059", "pin": "362759838e34e1525f1cc27daddaf663a193c059", "path": "ml_drift_delegate/delegate/delegate_kernel.cc", "lines": [110, 125], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "8073e27399609fdcb9d416757f695540dcad3bff", "url": "https://github.com/PowerBeef/LiteRT/blob/362759838e34e1525f1cc27daddaf663a193c059/ml_drift_delegate/delegate/delegate_kernel.cc#L110-L125"}, {"type": "code", "repo": "litert", "sha": "362759838e34e1525f1cc27daddaf663a193c059", "pin": "362759838e34e1525f1cc27daddaf663a193c059", "path": "ml_drift_delegate/delegate/buffer_handler_metal.mm", "lines": [253, 261], "symbol": null, "lines_sha1": "3731ed1b01c69db6a8500efc65829d6bfd791c68", "url": "https://github.com/PowerBeef/LiteRT/blob/362759838e34e1525f1cc27daddaf663a193c059/ml_drift_delegate/delegate/buffer_handler_metal.mm#L253-L261"}], "applies_to": {"platform": "apple", "build": "documented", "model_rev": ""}}
